  "raw": "{\"answer\":\"CuriousLLM 是对 KGP 的增强：原文称 CuriousLLM 是「an enhancement that integrates a curiosity-driven reasoning mechanism into an LLM agent」，并将其定位为「CuriousLLM-enhanced KGP framework」[chunk_43145c0748762d6b4c650c65721f826f][chunk_5fc8dbfce1b251b220ab2cf787ef236b]。在 KGP 的遍历任务中，KGP 设计「an LLM-based KG traversal agent」，交替执行推理（生成下一步证据）与检索（选择最可能被访问的邻居）[chunk_4c2f9284ed69432f1dd6ad5217a9a783]。Follow-upQA 的输入为「questions and supporting evidence as input」，监督目标是「follow-up questions serving as ground truths」，证据充分信号是「use special tokens to signify that the retrieved evidence is sufficient」[chunk_43145c0748762d6b4c650c65721f826f]。\",\"citations\":[{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_43145c0748762d6b4c650c65721f826f\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_5fc8dbfce1b251b220ab2cf787ef236b\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_4c2f9284ed69432f1dd6ad5217a9a783\",\"quote_id\":\"q1\"},{\"chunk_id\":\"chunk_43145c0748762d6b4c650c65721f826f\",\"quote_id\":\"q2\"}],\"status\":\"ok\"}",
